ount\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-y \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mdatalinktype\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-z \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mpostrotate-command\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-Z \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4muser\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m--time-stamp-precision=\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mtstamp_precision\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m--micro \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m--nano \u001b(B\u001b[m]\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 1 (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[19;57H\u001b[?2026l"]
