[4337.086998, "o", "\u001b[17A\u001b[4mTCPDUMP\u001b(B\u001b[m(8)                                                                        System Manager's Manual                                                                       \u001b[4mTCPDUMP\u001b(B\u001b[m(8)\u001b[23;1H\u001b[1mNAME\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m       tcpdump - dump traffic on a network\u001b[26;1H\u001b[1mSYNOPSIS\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m       \u001b[1mtcpdump \u001b(B\u001b[m[ \u001b[1m-AbdDefhHIJKlLnNOpqStuUvxX# \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m-B \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mbuffer_size\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-c \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mcount\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m--count \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m-C \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mfile_size\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-E \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mspi@ipaddr\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4malgo:secret,...\u001b(B\u001b[m  ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-F \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mfile\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-G \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mrotate_seconds\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-i \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4minterface\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m--immediate-mode \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m-j \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mtstamp_type\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-m \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mmodule\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-M \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4msecret\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m--number \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m--print \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m-Q \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4min|out|inout\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[4337.087295, "o", "\u001b[21;1H\u001b[4mTCPDUMP\u001b(B\u001b[m(8)                                                                        System Manager's Manual                                                                       \u001b[4mTCPDUMP\u001b(B\u001b[m(8)\u001b[23;1H\u001b[1mNAME\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m       tcpdump - dump traffic on a network\u001b[26;1H\u001b[1mSYNOPSIS\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m       \u001b[1mtcpdump \u001b(B\u001b[m[ \u001b[1m-AbdDefhHIJKlLnNOpqStuUvxX# \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m-B \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mbuffer_size\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-c \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mcount\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m--count \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m-C \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mfile_size\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-E \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mspi@ipaddr\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4malgo:secret,...\u001b(B\u001b[m  ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-F \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mfile\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-G \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mrotate_seconds\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-i \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4minterface\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m--immediate-mode \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m-j \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mtstamp_type\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-m \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mmodule\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-M \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4msecret\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m--number \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m--print \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m-Q \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4min|out|inout\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-r \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mfile\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-s \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4msnaplen\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-T \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mtype\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m--version \u001b(B\u001b[m]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-V \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mfile\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-w \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mfile\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-W \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mfilecount\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-y \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mdatalinktype\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m-z \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mpostrotate-command\u001b(B\u001b[m ] [ \u001b[1m-Z \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4muser\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m--time-stamp-precision=\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mtstamp_precision\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m--micro \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m--nano \u001b(B\u001b[m]\u001b[36;35H"]
[4337.089704, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[1;1H\u001b[11S\u001b[25;35H\u001b[1mision=\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4mtstamp_precision\u001b(B\u001b[m ]\r\n               [ \u001b[1m--micro \u001b(B\u001b[m] [ \u001b[1m--nano \u001b(B\u001b[m]\r\n...skipping...\r\n              \u001b[7mtos\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4m\u001b[7mtos\u001b(B\u001b[m, ttl \u001b[4mttl\u001b(B\u001b[m, id \u001b[4mid\u001b(B\u001b[m, offset \u001b[4moffset\u001b(B\u001b[m, flags [\u001b[4mflags\u001b(B\u001b[m], proto \u001b[4mproto\u001b(B\u001b[m, length \u001b[4mlength\u001b(B\u001b[m, options (\u001b[4moptions\u001b(B\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n       \u001b[4m\u001b[7mtos\u001b(B\u001b[m is the type of service field; if the ECN bits are non-zero, those are reported as \u001b[1mECT(1)\u001b(B\u001b[m, \u001b[1mECT(0)\u001b(B\u001b[m, or \u001b[1mCE\u001b(B\u001b[m.  \u001b[4mttl\u001b(B\u001b[m is the time-to-live; it is not reported if it is zero.  \u001b[4mid\u001b(B\u001b[m is the\u001b[K\r\n       IP identification field.  \u001b[4moffset\u001b(B\u001b[m is the fragment offset field; it is printed whether this is part of a fragmented datagram or not.  \u001b[4mflags\u001b(B\u001b[m are the MF and DF flags; \u001b[1m+ \u001b(B\u001b[mis reported if\u001b[K\r\n       MF is set, and \u001b[1mDF \u001b(B\u001b[mis reported if F is set.  If neither are set, \u001b[1m. \u001b(B\u001b[mis reported.  \u001b[4mproto\u001b(B\u001b[m is the protocol ID field.  \u001b[4mlength\u001b(B\u001b[m is the total length field.  \u001b[4moptions\u001b(B\u001b[m are the IP options,  if\u001b[K\r\n       any.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n       Next, for TCP and UDP packets, the source and destination IP addresses and TCP or UDP ports, with a dot between each IP address and its corresponding port, will be printed, with a\u001b[K\r\n       >  separating  the source and destination.  For other protocols, the addresses will be printed, with a > separating the source and destination.  Higher level protocol information,\u001b[K\r\n       if any, will be printed after that.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n       For fragmented IP datagrams, the first fragment contains the higher level protocol header; fragments after the first contain no higher level protocol header.  Fragmentation infor\u001b[K‐\r\u001b[7S\u001b[6A       mation will be printed only with the \u001b[1m-v \u001b(B\u001b[mflag, in the IP header information, as described above.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n       \u001b[1mTCP Packets\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n       \u001b[4m(N.B.:The\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mfollowing\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mdescription\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4massumes\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mfamiliarity\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mwith\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mthe\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mTCP\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mprotocol\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mdescribed\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4min\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mRFC-793.\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[4mIf\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4myou\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mare\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mnot\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mfamiliar\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mwith\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mthe\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mprotocol,\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mthis\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mdescription\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mwill\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mnot\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[4mbe\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[4mof\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[4mmuch\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n       \u001b[4muse\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4mto\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4myou.)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 481/904 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4345.000667, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[21;1H\u001bM       If the \u001b[1m-v \u001b(B\u001b[mflag is specified, information from the IPv4 header is shown in parentheses after the \u001b[1mIP \u001b(B\u001b[mor the link-layer header.  The general format of this information is:\u001b[38;1H\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 480/904 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
