[4381.191801, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[K\u001b[21;38r\u001b[21;1H\u001bM       Next, for TCP and UDP packets, the source and destination IP addresses and TCP or UDP ports, with a dot between each IP address and its corresponding port, will be printed, with a\u001b[38;1H\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 487/904 59% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
