[4381.751644, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[21;1H\u001bM       MF is set, and \u001b[1mDF \u001b(B\u001b[mis reported if F is set.  If neither are set, \u001b[1m. \u001b(B\u001b[mis reported.  \u001b[4mproto\u001b(B\u001b[m is the protocol ID field.  \u001b[4mlength\u001b(B\u001b[m is the total length field.  \u001b[4moptions\u001b(B\u001b[m are the IP options,  if\u001b[38;1H\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 484/904 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4381.783238, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[4381.783431, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[21;1H\u001bM       IP identification field.  \u001b[4moffset\u001b(B\u001b[m is the fragment offset field; it is printed whether this is part of a fragmented datagram or not.  \u001b[4mflags\u001b(B\u001b[m are the MF and DF flags; \u001b[1m+ \u001b(B\u001b[mis reported if\u001b[38;1H\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 483/904 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4381.816477, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[K\u001b[21;38r\u001b[21;1H\u001bM       \u001b[4m\u001b[7mtos\u001b(B\u001b[m is the type of service field; if the ECN bits are non-zero, those are reported as \u001b[1mECT(1)\u001b(B\u001b[m, \u001b[1mECT(0)\u001b(B\u001b[m, or \u001b[1mCE\u001b(B\u001b[m.  \u001b[4mttl\u001b(B\u001b[m is the time-to-live; it is not reported if it is zero.  \u001b[4mid\u001b(B\u001b[m is the\u001b[38;1H\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 482/904 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4381.851866, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[K\u001b[21;38r\u001b[21;1H\u001bM              \u001b[7mtos\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[4m\u001b[7mtos\u001b(B\u001b[m, ttl \u001b[4mttl\u001b(B\u001b[m, id \u001b[4mid\u001b(B\u001b[m, offset \u001b[4moffset\u001b(B\u001b[m, flags [\u001b[4mflags\u001b(B\u001b[m], proto \u001b[4mproto\u001b(B\u001b[m, length \u001b[4mlength\u001b(B\u001b[m, options (\u001b[4moptions\u001b(B\u001b[m)\u001b[38;1H\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 481/904 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4381.883136, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[4381.883446, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[21;1H\u001bM       If the \u001b[1m-v \u001b(B\u001b[mflag is specified, information from the IPv4 header is shown in parentheses after the \u001b[1mIP \u001b(B\u001b[mor the link-layer header.  The general format of this information is:\u001b[38;1H\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 480/904 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
