[4423.142301, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[38;1H\n\u001b[A       The general format of a TCP protocol line is:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 483/904 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4423.646116, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[38;1H\n\u001b[A              \u001b[4msrc\u001b(B\u001b[m > \u001b[4mdst\u001b(B\u001b[m: Flags [\u001b[4mtcpflags\u001b(B\u001b[m], seq \u001b[4mdata-seqno\u001b(B\u001b[m, ack \u001b[4mackno\u001b(B\u001b[m, win \u001b[4mwindow\u001b(B\u001b[m, urg \u001b[4murgent\u001b(B\u001b[m, options [\u001b[4mopts\u001b(B\u001b[m], length \u001b[4mlen\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 484/904 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4423.679189, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[38;1H\n\u001b[A       \u001b[4mSrc\u001b(B\u001b[m and \u001b[4mdst\u001b(B\u001b[m are the source and destination IP addresses and ports.  \u001b[4mTcpflags\u001b(B\u001b[m are some combination of S (SYN), F (FIN), P (PUSH), R (RST), U (URG), W (ECN CWR), E (ECN-Echo) or `.'\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 485/904 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4423.713195, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[38;1H\n\u001b[A       (ACK),  or `none' if no flags are set.  \u001b[4mData-seqno\u001b(B\u001b[m describes the portion of sequence space covered by the data in this packet (see example below).  \u001b[4mAckno\u001b(B\u001b[m is sequence number of the\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 486/904 59% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4423.750343, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[38;1H\n\u001b[A       next data expected the other direction on this connection.  \u001b[4mWindow\u001b(B\u001b[m is the number of bytes of receive buffer space available the other direction on this connection.  \u001b[4mUrg\u001b(B\u001b[m  indicates\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 487/904 59% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4423.780362, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[38;1H\n\u001b[A       there is `urgent' data in the packet.  \u001b[4mOpts\u001b(B\u001b[m are TCP options (e.g., mss 1024).  \u001b[4mLen\u001b(B\u001b[m is the length of payload data.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 488/904 59% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4423.814762, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[38;1H\n\u001b[A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 489/904 59% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
[4423.847217, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[38;1H\n\u001b[A       \u001b[4mIptype\u001b(B\u001b[m, \u001b[4mSrc\u001b(B\u001b[m, \u001b[4mdst\u001b(B\u001b[m, and \u001b[4mflags\u001b(B\u001b[m are always present.  The other fields depend on the contents of the packet's TCP protocol header and are output only if appropriate.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 490/904 59% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
