[4425.333771, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[21;38r\u001b[38;1H\n\u001b[A              IP csam.login > rtsg.1023: Flags [P.], seq 2:3, ack 21, win 4077, urg 1, length 1\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page tcpdump(8) line 500/904 61% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1;38r\u001b[38;73H\u001b[?2026l"]
